    {
      "id": "coast_rell_tide_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“A way in, at the bottom of a spring tide.” He does not have to look it up. “Open about an hour. I have sold gear to four parties who meant to go in and I have had two of them back.” He straightens a coil. “I do not sell them the rope any more. They buy it at Gullmere and think I do not know.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "coast_watch_tide"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "coast_rell_tide_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "coast_rell_tide_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
